// The route search's fastest runs of the first level (design.md, "The agent loop"): any% and
// 100%, tool-assisted, and the same human-possible: each input has slack, and a slip of a tick
// or two is recoverable within a second (route/slack.wrela; route/tests.wrela checks them for
// it). No person has played them. `wrela tool route` searches for better ones and writes this
// file again, with the tests' times; run it again when a change to the movement moves them.

use course::course
use pad::{DOWN, Hold, JUMP, LEFT, PRESS, RIGHT, UP, hold}
use world::{LEVEL, play}

