/// The first level with every snack (100%), human-possible, in 1962 ticks.
/// Every stretch of buttons is held 3 ticks or more, and jump is pressed only after it was let
/// go. Of its 284 changes of buttons, each moved 1 or 2 ticks early or late, 279 live
/// through the second after, 261 through two seconds, and 219 through the whole
/// run with every later button as it was. Human-possible means each input has slack and a slip
